  "content": "<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"WebPage\",\n  \"name\": \"Custom Soccer Jerseys for Stag Dos & Bachelor Parties — MOMUTO\",\n  \"description\": \"One custom soccer kit for the whole group — groom front and center, nicknames and numbers on every back. Design it free in 3D or send an AI concept. No minimum order. From $25.90/jersey at 10+.\",\n  \"url\": \"/pages/bachelor-party-football-shirts\",\n  \"inLanguage\": \"en\",\n  \"breadcrumb\": {\n    \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\",\n    \"itemListElement\": [\n      { \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"/\" },\n      { \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Bachelor Party Soccer Jerseys\", \"item\": \"/pages/bachelor-party-football-shirts\" }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How far in advance should we order stag do soccer jerseys?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Order at least 5 weeks before the party. Production takes 7-12 days and worldwide shipping 10-15 days — 25-30 days total. The design itself is fast: build it free in the 3D configurator in minutes, or get a designer mockup in 24-48h.\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can every jersey have a different nickname and number?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes — that's the point. One shared design, then each jersey gets its own name (or inside-joke nickname), number and size. Mixed sizes are no problem and cost nothing extra.\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can we use an AI-generated design for the group's jersey?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Absolutely. Generate a concept with ChatGPT or Midjourney — the groom's face as a crest, the destination skyline, whatever the group votes for — and MOMUTO's designers rebuild it as a real, printable kit. $15 design deposit, credited in full to orders of 5+ jerseys, which a stag group nearly always is.\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What do bachelor party soccer jerseys cost?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"From $25.90 per jersey at 10+ units ($45.90 for a single jersey), with names, numbers and full-color sublimation printing included. A typical 10-person stag group pays around €22 per head — less than the first round of drinks.\" }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\" /><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\" /><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&amp;family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\" />\n<style>\n:root { --bg:#0a0a0a; --panel:#111; --border:rgba(255,255,255,0.07); --white:#f5f5f5; --muted:#a1a1aa; --dim:#71717a; --red:#c8352e; --red-h:#e04038; --fd:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif; --fb:'Outfit',sans-serif; }\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\n.title{display:none}\nbody{font-family:var(--fb);font-weight:300;background:var(--bg);color:var(--white);line-height:1.65;overflow-x:hidden}\nh1,h2,h3{font-family:var(--fd);font-weight:400;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.03em;line-height:1}\n.acc{color:var(--red)}\n.wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.5rem}\n.hero{padding:5.5rem 1.5rem 4rem;text-align:center;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%,#1a1a1a 0%,var(--bg) 70%);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}\n.badge{background:rgba(200,53,46,.1);border:1px solid rgba(200,53,46,.18);color:var(--red);font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;padding:6px 14px;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:1.4rem}\n.h1{font-size:clamp(2.6rem,6vw,4.2rem);max-width:880px;margin:0 auto 1.4rem}\n.sub{color:var(--muted);font-size:1rem;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto 2.2rem;text-align:center}\n.btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--red);color:#fff;padding:16px 40px;font-weight:700;font-size:.82rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid var(--red);transition:all .2s}\n.btn:hover{background:var(--red-h);transform:translateY(-2px)}\n.btn2{display:inline-block;background:transparent;color:var(--white);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);padding:14px 34px;font-weight:600;font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;transition:all .2s;margin-left:.6rem}\n.btn2:hover{border-color:var(--red);color:var(--red)}\n.sec{padding:4rem 0}\n.sec h2{font-size:clamp(1.9rem,4vw,2.6rem);margin-bottom:.6rem;text-align:center}\n.sec .lead{color:var(--muted);text-align:center;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 3rem;font-size:.95rem}\n.grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:1.5rem}\n.card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1.8rem}\n.card h3{font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:.6rem}\n.card p{font-size:.87rem;color:var(--muted)}\n.card .n{font-family:var(--fd);font-size:1.6rem;color:var(--red);display:block;margin-bottom:.5rem}\n.notice{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:1.6rem 2rem;background:var(--panel);border-left:3px solid var(--red)}\n.notice p{font-size:.95rem}\n.faq{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto}\n.faq details{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:1.2rem 0}\n.faq summary{font-weight:600;font-size:.95rem;cursor:pointer;list-style:none}\n.faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n.faq summary::after{content:'+';float:right;color:var(--red);font-weight:400}\n.faq details[open] summary::after{content:'−'}\n.faq p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.88rem;margin-top:.7rem;max-width:720px}\n.cta-end{padding:5rem 1.5rem;text-align:center;background:var(--panel);border-top:1px solid var(--border)}\n.cta-end h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,2.8rem);margin-bottom:1rem}\n.cta-end p{color:var(--muted);max-width:560px;margin:0 auto 2rem;font-size:.95rem}\n.more{padding:2.5rem 1.5rem;text-align:center;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--dim)}\n.more a{color:var(--muted)}\n@media(max-width:520px){.btn2{margin-left:0;margin-top:.8rem}}\n</style>\n\n<section class=\"hero\">\n<div class=\"badge\">Stag Dos &middot; Bachelor Parties</div>\n<h1 class=\"h1\">One Kit. One Legend.<br />The Whole <span class=\"acc\">Stag Squad</span> Matching.</h1>\n<p class=\"sub\">A custom soccer jersey is the stag do uniform that actually gets kept. One shared design &mdash; the groom front and center &mdash; then every jersey gets its own nickname, number and size. Design it yourself, free, in 3D. Or send us the group's AI concept and we'll make it real.</p>\n<a href=\"/pages/design-your-own-soccer-jersey\" class=\"btn\">Design It Free in 3D</a>\n<a href=\"/pages/request-custom-kit-design#cta-form\" class=\"btn2\">Send Us Your Idea</a>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\">\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<h2>Why Groups Order From Us</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">We make kits for real soccer teams &mdash; stag groups from France, Spain and Austria found us and kept coming. Same pro fabric, same printing, more inside jokes.</p>\n<div class=\"grid3\">\n<div class=\"card\"><h3>A nickname on every back</h3><p>One design for the group, personalized per jersey: names, nicknames the groom will hate, numbers, mixed sizes. No extra cost per personalization.</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><h3>Any idea, made printable</h3><p>The destination skyline, a fake club crest, the groom's face where the sponsor goes. Generate it with AI or describe it &mdash; <a href=\"/pages/ai-concept-to-real-kit\" style=\"color:var(--red);\">our designers rebuild concepts as real kits</a> every day.</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><h3>Real kit quality</h3><p>Full dye-sublimation on a polyester-elastane performance blend &mdash; the print never peels or fades, so the jersey survives the weekend and the decade after. Lifetime print guarantee.</p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\" style=\"background:var(--panel);border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\">\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<h2>How It Works</h2>\n<div class=\"grid3\">\n<div class=\"card\"><span class=\"n\">1</span><h3>Create the design</h3><p>Fastest: build it in the free 3D configurator in minutes. Or send an idea, sketch or AI render &mdash; a designer returns a mockup in 24&ndash;48h ($15 deposit, credited in full at 5+ jerseys &mdash; which a stag group always is).</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><span class=\"n\">2</span><h3>Add the squad list</h3><p>Names, nicknames, numbers and a size per person. Collect them in the group chat, paste them in.</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><span class=\"n\">3</span><h3>Delivered in 25&ndash;30 days</h3><p>Production 7&ndash;12 days, shipping 10&ndash;15. <strong>Order at least 5 weeks before the party.</strong> From $25.90/jersey at 10+ &mdash; about the price of the first round.</p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"sec\"><div class=\"notice\">\n<p><strong>Hen parties too.</strong> Same kits, same personalization, any color scheme &mdash; soccer jerseys for bachelorette weekends are half of what this page is about. If the group can agree on a design, we can print it.</p>\n</div></div>\n\n<section class=\"sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\">\n<div class=\"faq\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:2rem\">Stag Jersey Questions</h2>\n<details><summary>How far in advance should we order?</summary><p>At least 5 weeks before the party: 7&ndash;12 days production + 10&ndash;15 days shipping. The design part is fast &mdash; minutes in the 3D tool, or 24&ndash;48h for a designer mockup.</p></details>\n<details><summary>Can every jersey have a different nickname and number?</summary><p>Yes &mdash; one shared design, individual name/nickname, number and size per jersey. Mixed sizes cost nothing extra.</p></details>\n<details><summary>Can we use an AI-generated design?</summary><p>Yes. Generate it with ChatGPT or Midjourney and send it over &mdash; our designers rebuild it as a printable kit. $15 deposit, credited in full at 5+ jerseys.</p></details>\n<details><summary>What does it cost?</summary><p>From $25.90/jersey at 10+ units ($45.90 single), personalization and full-color printing included. A 10-person group: about &euro;22 a head.</p></details>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"cta-end\">\n<h2>The group chat has been arguing long enough</h2>\n<p>Settle it: build the jersey in 3D right now, free &mdash; or send us the idea and get a real mockup back within 48 hours.</p>\n<a href=\"/pages/design-your-own-soccer-jersey\" class=\"btn\">Start Designing Free</a>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"more\">More from MOMUTO: <a href=\"/pages/ai-concept-to-real-kit\">AI concepts made real</a> &middot; <a href=\"/pages/custom-kit-gallery\">the recreated-designs gallery</a> &middot; <a href=\"/pages/request-custom-kit-design\">request a custom design</a></div>",
